&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform (&quot;Codeless&quot;). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
